{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WellTemperament"}],"title":"WellTemperament","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WellTemperament"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/init(fifths:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/fifths"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/Fifth"],"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/TuningSystem-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament"],"tra